.TH QUIPU-SIGNER-ENROLL 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-signer\-enroll \- Enroll a hardware signer credential
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu signer enroll\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-credential\-id\fR] [\fB\-\-cose\-key\fR] [\fB\-\-scheme\fR] [\fB\-\-origin\fR] [\fB\-\-rp\-id\fR] [\fB\-\-actor\fR] [\fB\-\-graph\fR] [\fB\-\-expires\-at\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Enroll a hardware signer credential
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-credential\-id\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-cose\-key\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-scheme\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-origin\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-rp\-id\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-actor\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-graph\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-expires\-at\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
